      "text": "@emollick The web was built for humans reading pages and bots indexing them.\n\nAn agent reading a book one search at a time breaks both assumptions.\n\nI think we end up with a separate agent layer: paid, rate-limited access for agents, free pages for humans. Your donation is the prototype.",
