        "text": "The traffic from agent swarms doing research is going to be quite large, they are relentless. I had Fable 5.2 reconstruct WH Auden's 1941 poetry class. It found an obscure, relevant book on the Internet Archive, which it read a line at a time by doing repeated full text searches. https://t.co/bBtxGguUuT"
      },
